<h1>TourMicroservicesLab</h1>
<p>LAB-001: local HTTPS, PostgreSQL, authentication, and five independent hosts.</p>
<p>LAB-002: <a href="/tours">browse tours and sessions</a>; Admin can maintain the catalog.</p>
<p>LAB-004: reserve a session and inspect <a href="/reservations">your reservation timeline</a>, <a href="/payments">simulated payment</a> and <a href="/notifications">simulated notification</a>. No real money or email is used. Refunds, cancellation and complete compensation remain LAB-005.</p>
<p><a href="/login" data-enhance-nav="false">Sign in</a> using a seeded account from your private local configuration.</p>
